{"title": "Adrenaline Rush", "pageid": 28421, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Adrenaline_Rush", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Adrenaline Rush</b> is a passive feature that grants a character wrath every time they dash during combat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> you gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\">Wrath</a> for 3 turns.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Wrath\"> Condition: Wrath </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\">Wrath</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>You have a +1 bonus to damage with melee weapons for every turn this condition has remaining.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Linebreaker_Boots\" title=\"Linebreaker Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Linebreaker_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Linebreaker_Boots\" title=\"Linebreaker Boots\">Linebreaker Boots</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Zurk\" title=\"Zurk\">Zurk</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip stating that Adrenaline Rush grants 2 turns of Wrath is incorrect, it actually grants 3 turns of the condition.</li>\n<li>The in-game tooltip states that Adrenaline Rush is once per turn, but it is not.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When you <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> you gain <a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\">Wrath</a> for 3 turns.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200137\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1774/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14829/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4113/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 854069/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.136      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   57.136      1 -total\n 24.24%   13.850      3 Template:Icon_link\n 23.43%   13.385      3 Template:Icon_text\n 21.89%   12.507     14 Template:Trim\n 19.94%   11.394      1 Template:SAI\n 17.41%    9.947      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 16.90%    9.658      5 Template:Ifempty\n 13.63%    7.785      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 12.91%    7.376      1 Template:Cond\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28421-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200137 and revision id 385403. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}